// spec: 3a, 7
// `fit=stretch` on a `shape from` SVG that distorts its aspect ratio by over 5% is `image-distort`; a kept ratio and the default `contain` are quiet.
diagram "svg shape distort" size (400,120)
shape s from "tri.svg" fit=stretch
shape c from "tri.svg"
box a at (20,20) size (80,80) shape=s
box b at (140,20) size (80,40) shape=s
box k at (260,20) size (80,80) shape=c
